OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith patchy cloud. A fresher breeze
OL,7,Finitially though the evening easing
OL,8,Fovernight. Feeling cold, with a frost
OL,9,Fand some freezing fog patches likely
OL,10,Fby dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry, frosty start. Early fog
OL,13,Fwill slowly clear as cloud thickens
OL,14,Finto the afternoon bringing outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain. Milder by day but turning
OL,16,Fcolder once again overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
