OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCold
OL,6,Fand bright to start but turning more
OL,7,Funsettled as rain later Monday brings
OL,8,Fa risk of some transitory snow on
OL,9,Fhigher ground. Spells of rain
OL,10,Fpersisting Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
